00:59:52.000 --> 01:00:49.000
Needing to do some lining, Metta prepared to stand, but Peter urged her to stay put and enjoy the coziness. Eventually, Metta dragged herself away to do housework. At 5.51pm, Peter looked outside and noticed an unfamiliar man sitting alone on a garden seat on their front terrace. The stranger was unshaven, appeared to be aged in his 40s or 50s with a burly physique and dark hair with grey streaks. He was dressed in black with a long coat, holding a brown envelope. Peter told Metta of the man outside before making his way to the patio to greet him. As he headed out, Peter's youngest daughter ran towards him, but he shut the door behind him, causing the two-year-old to burst into tears. Metta led her daughter further into the house to comfort her.
需要熨烫一些衣服，梅塔准备站起来，但彼得敦促她留下来享受舒适。最终，梅塔把自己拖开去做家务。下午5点51分，彼得向外看去，注意到一个生面孔的男人独自坐在前露台的花园长椅上。这个陌生人没有刮胡子，看起来四十或五十岁，身材魁梧，黑发中夹杂着灰发。他穿着黑色长衣，拿着一个棕色信封。彼得把外面有人的事告诉了梅塔，然后朝露台走去迎接他。当他走出去时，彼得最小的女儿向他跑去，但他把门关上了，导致这个两岁的孩子放声大哭。梅塔把女儿带到屋里更深处去安慰她。

